Here `p` starts at `in_buf` and advances while `*p == ' '`. But `in_buf` is `data_sds` which is null-terminated (it's an flb_sds). So `*p` will eventually hit the null terminator. But wait, `in_size` is `flb_sds_len(data_sds)`, so `p` could advance past `in_buf + in_size` if there are spaces beyond the string length. But since `data_sds` is null-terminated, `*p` will be `\0` at `in_buf + in_size`, so the loop stops. OK.

