Hmm, let me look at the `flb_unescape_string_utf8` function again more carefully:

```c
int flb_unescape_string_utf8(const char *in_buf, int sz, char *out_buf)
{
    ...
    while (in_buf < end && *in_buf && count_in < sz) {
        next = in_buf + 1;
        if (next < end && *in_buf == '\\') {
            esc_in = 2;
            switch (*next) {
            ...
            default:
